<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech builder sees higher '96 net profit.</title>
<headline>Czech builder sees higher '96 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech builder Metrostav a.s. on Tuesday forecast its 1996 net profit to rise to about 92 million crowns from a 71.5 million crown net profit last year.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect 1996 net profit to be between 91-92 million crowns,&quot; Metrostav spokesman Jiri Tecl told Reuters.</p>
</text>
